# __IF:api__
## HTTP API

```bash
just serve            # http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

Interactive OpenAPI docs at `/docs` (Swagger UI) and `/redoc`; the raw schema
is at `/openapi.json`.
# __END__

# __IF:ml__
## Notebooks

`notebooks/` holds exploratory [marimo](https://marimo.io/) notebooks. They are
real `.py` files, so they diff, lint, and test like any other module.

```bash
just notebook                                  # interactive
uv run notebooks/example.py --help             # the same notebook as a CLI
```
# __END__

# __IF:rust__
## Rust extension

```bash
just build-rust       # uv run maturin develop --uv
```

`uv sync` does **not** rebuild the Rust extension. Re-run `just build-rust`
after every change under `rust/`.
# __END__

